@startuml
title TARGET Web sale - commit antes de confirmar
actor Owner
participant Browser
participant API
participant "Shared Application / Domain" as domain
database PostgreSQL as db
Owner -> Browser : Confirma venta
Browser -> API : POST sales / operationId / precio explicito
API -> API : Sesion, owner, CSRF, shape
API -> db : BEGIN / lock Inventory / receipt
alt Receipt ya existe
  db --> API : Resultado original
else Nuevo comando
  API -> db : Leer Products/States scoped
  API -> domain : Validar/calcular exacto
  domain --> API : Sale/items/movements/states
  API -> db : Guardar todo + receipt + ChangeSet
end
API -> db : COMMIT
API --> Browser : Resultado + revisiones
Browser --> Owner : Venta registrada; refetch
note over Browser,API : ACK perdido: consultar receipt/retry MISMA key.
@enduml
